    <mxCell id="sub" value="S1: HSZ → DAL   |   S2: KHH → CHI   |   S3: TPE → NYC        Each shipment is &lt;b&gt;loaded into a shared container&lt;/b&gt; at origin CFS, deconsolidated at destination CFS.  Joint decision: shipment-to-container × container-to-sailing.  Blue nodes = shared supply." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
